<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#FFFDF5">
  <meta name="description" content="Start a 30-day AdHello trial — pay-per-performance marketing, referral network, and reviews on every job. You only pay commission on leads you approve. No credit card.">
  <meta property="og:title" content="AdHello — pay-per-performance marketing &amp; referrals">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Get leads when you approve them, grow through referrals, and collect reviews on every job. 30 days free — no credit card.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <title>Start your 30-day trial · AdHello</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/adhello-app-icon.png" type="image/png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/custom.css?v=<%= typeof assetVersion !== 'undefined' ? assetVersion : '1' %>">
  <%- include('partials/tailwind_css', { twVariant: 'standalone' }) %>
  <style>
    /* AdHello.io tokens — form-focused signup (sales lives on adhello.io) */
    :root {
      --fa-yellow: #facc15;
      --fa-yellow-hot: #eab308;
      --fa-ink: #1f242e;
      --fa-muted: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.75);
      --fa-muted-soft: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.6);
      --fa-cream: #FFFDF5;
      --fa-line: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.1);
      --fa-font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      --fa-btn-radius: 12px;
      --fa-btn-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    body.fa-page {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: var(--fa-font);
      background: var(--fa-cream);
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .fa-main {
      min-height: 100vh;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .fa-card {
      max-width: 28rem;
      width: 100%;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -24px rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.18);
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) { .fa-card { padding: 2.5rem; } }
    .fa-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }
    .fa-brand img { width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; border-radius: 0.7rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .fa-brand strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      line-height: 1.15;
    }
    .fa-brand span {
      display: block;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--fa-muted-soft);
      margin-top: 0.1rem;
    }
    .fa-card h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-card-lead {
      margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--fa-muted);
    }
    .fa-benefits {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }
    .fa-benefits li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      padding: 0.7rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.28);
    }
    .fa-benefits__ico {
      width: 1.75rem;
      height: 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      background: var(--fa-yellow);
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .fa-benefits strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .fa-benefits span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.15rem;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: var(--fa-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .fa-field { margin-top: 0.9rem; }
    .fa-field label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--fa-muted-soft);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }
    .fa-field label .opt {
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: none;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      color: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.45);
    }
    .fa-field input {
      width: 100%;
      height: 2.9rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      background: #fff;
      padding: 0 0.9rem;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      outline: none;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: var(--fa-font);
    }
    .fa-field input:focus {
      border-color: var(--fa-yellow-hot);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.28);
    }
    .fa-perks {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem 1rem;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--fa-muted);
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .fa-perks span::before {
      content: '✓';
      color: #10b981;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-right: 0.35rem;
    }
    .fa-terms {
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-terms input {
      margin-top: 0.15rem;
      width: 1.1rem;
      height: 1.1rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      accent-color: var(--fa-yellow-hot);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .fa-terms label { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: var(--fa-muted); }
    .fa-terms a { color: var(--fa-ink); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: underline; }
    .fa-terms-details {
      margin-top: 0.65rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background: rgba(255, 253, 245, 0.8);
      padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--fa-muted);
    }
    .fa-terms-details summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      list-style: none;
    }
    .fa-terms-details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .fa-terms-details[open] summary { margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
    .fa-terms-details ul { margin: 0.35rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; }
    .fa-terms-details li + li { margin-top: 0.25rem; }
    .fa-btn {
      width: 100%;
      height: 3.5rem;
      margin-top: 2.75rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: var(--fa-btn-radius);
      background: #facc15;
      color: #1f242e;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 16px;
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.15s;
      font-family: var(--fa-font);
    }
    .fa-btn:hover { background: #eab308; }
    .fa-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.72; cursor: wait; pointer-events: none; background: #e5c412; }
    .fa-foot { margin-top: 2.5rem; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fa-muted-soft); line-height: 1.45; }
    .fa-foot a { color: var(--fa-ink); font-weight: 700; }
    .fa-errors {
      background: #fef2f2;
      border: 1px solid #fecaca;
      color: #b91c1c;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .fa-errors li + li { margin-top: 0.2rem; }
    .fa-ok {
      background: #ecfdf5;
      border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
      color: #065f46;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
    }
    .fa-back {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--fa-muted-soft);
    }
    .fa-back a { color: var(--fa-ink); font-weight: 700; }
    @media (max-width: 639px) {
      .fa-main { padding: 1.25rem 1rem; align-items: stretch; }
      .fa-card { border-radius: 1.1rem; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
      .fa-perks { gap: 0.35rem 0.85rem; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .fa-card { animation: fa-rise 0.45s ease-out both; }
      .fa-btn { transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease; }
      .fa-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
      @keyframes fa-rise {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="fa-page">
  <% const _f = form || {}; %>
  <% const _login = typeof loginHref !== 'undefined' ? loginHref : '/m/login'; %>
  <% const _trial = typeof trialSignupHref !== 'undefined' ? trialSignupHref : '/signup'; %>

  <main class="fa-main">
    <div class="fa-card">
      <a class="fa-brand" href="https://adhello.io" rel="noopener">
        <img src="/images/adhello-app-icon.png" alt="AdHello" width="40" height="40" />
        <div>
          <strong>AdHello</strong>
          <span>Pay-per-performance</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <% if (sent) { %>
        <h1>Check your phone</h1>
        <p class="fa-card-lead">If that number or email is valid, your AdHello app link is on its way. Open it, then Share → Add to Home Screen.</p>
        <div class="fa-ok" role="status">Link sent. It can take a minute. Already have it? <a class="underline font-semibold" href="<%= _login %>">Get a fresh link</a>.</div>
        <p class="fa-foot" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Want the full workspace (leads, SMS, email, GHL CRM)? <a class="underline" href="<%= _trial %>">Start a free trial</a>.</p>
      <% } else { %>
        <h1>Start your 30-day trial</h1>
        <p class="fa-card-lead">Grow with <strong>pay-per-performance marketing</strong> and a referral network — you only pay commission on leads you approve. Plus reviews and jobs on your phone. Free for 30 days — no credit card.</p>

        <ul class="fa-benefits" aria-label="What you get">
          <li>
            <span class="fa-benefits__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v18m0-18l4 4m-4-4L8 7M4 14h16"/></svg></span>
            <div>
              <strong>Pay-per-performance marketing</strong>
              <span>Get leads through the app. Approve what you want — commission only on leads you accept. Decline the rest at no cost.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fa-benefits__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12h15m0 0l-5.25-5.25M19.5 12l-5.25 5.25"/></svg></span>
            <div>
              <strong>Referral network that feeds you work</strong>
              <span>Send and receive referrals with partners in your area — grow without cold calling strangers.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fa-benefits__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2.5l2.7 5.5 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1L12 16.4 6.6 19.3l1-6.1L3.2 8.9l6.1-.9L12 2.5z"/></svg></span>
            <div>
              <strong>Reviews &amp; jobs on every site</strong>
              <span>Ask for Google reviews when the job wraps, and keep customers &amp; jobs on your Home Screen — no App Store.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="fa-perks"><span>Pay per performance</span><span>Referrals</span><span>30-day free trial</span></div>

        <% if (errors && errors.length) { %>
          <ul class="fa-errors" role="alert">
            <% errors.forEach(function (e) { %><li><%= e %></li><% }) %>
          </ul>
        <% } %>

        <form method="post" action="/app" class="mt-2" id="fa-form" autocomplete="on">
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-name">Your name</label>
            <input id="fa-name" name="contactName" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120" value="<%= _f.contactName || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-company">Business name</label>
            <input id="fa-company" name="companyName" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="160" value="<%= _f.companyName || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-phone">Mobile number</label>
            <input id="fa-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" maxlength="40" value="<%= _f.phone || '' %>" placeholder="We’ll text your app link">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-email">Email <span class="opt">(if you prefer email)</span></label>
            <input id="fa-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="200" value="<%= _f.email || '' %>">
          </div>

          <div class="fa-terms">
            <input id="fa-terms" name="acceptTerms" type="checkbox" value="on" required <%= _f.acceptTerms ? 'checked' : '' %>>
            <label for="fa-terms">
              I agree to the <a href="#fa-terms-details">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>: AdHello Reviews is a
              <strong>pay-per-performance</strong> model. I will pay commission on leads I receive through the app
              <strong>after I approve them</strong>.
            </label>
          </div>
          <details class="fa-terms-details" id="fa-terms-details">
            <summary>Terms &amp; Conditions — pay-per-performance</summary>
            <ul>
              <li>The Reviews app trial and core tools may be free; lead delivery is <strong>pay-per-performance</strong>.</li>
              <li>When you receive a lead through the app, you choose whether to <strong>approve</strong> (accept) it.</li>
              <li>Approving a lead means you agree to pay the applicable <strong>commission</strong> for that lead.</li>
              <li>Declining a lead does not create a commission obligation for that lead.</li>
              <li>By checking the box above and submitting this form, you accept these Terms &amp; Conditions.</li>
            </ul>
          </details>

          <button type="submit" class="fa-btn" id="fa-submit">Text me my trial link</button>
        </form>
        <script>
          (function () {
            var form = document.getElementById('fa-form');
            var btn = document.getElementById('fa-submit');
            if (!form || !btn) return;
            var locked = false;
            form.addEventListener('submit', function (ev) {
              if (locked) {
                ev.preventDefault();
                return;
              }
              locked = true;
              btn.disabled = true;
              btn.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');
              btn.textContent = 'Sending…';
            });
            if (document.querySelector('.fa-errors')) {
              form.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
            }
          })();
        </script>

        <p class="fa-foot">Already in a network? <a class="underline" href="<%= _login %>">Get your link</a>. Need leads + CRM? <a class="underline" href="<%= _trial %>">Start Agency OS trial</a>.</p>
      <% } %>
    </div>
    <p class="fa-back">Learn more at <a href="https://adhello.io" rel="noopener">adhello.io</a></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
